{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being deployed into enemy territory for the first time, your unit is ambushed and you become a prisoner of war. Until you break out of prison, carving a path of destruction on your way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/9e873e535a7be1d6f3b4160c39610745.poster.avif?t=1752217469\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/9e873e535a7be1d6f3b4160c39610745.webm?t=1752217469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/9e873e535a7be1d6f3b4160c39610745.mp4?t=1752217469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/9c418bc6e7ef8519734bd84d9094db70.avif?t=1752217469\" width=616 height=132 /></span>Fight against endless hordes of enemies and try to obtain a high score in the wave-based Infinite Mode! Choose from one of 20+ maps and customize your experience with more than 50+ game-play modifiers or play one of the 15+ challenge modes. Unlock hundreds of cosmetics and achievements for reaching score and wave milestones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/1c3bdf7b864373012d1bb9b5dc14b9d0.poster.avif?t=1752217469\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/1c3bdf7b864373012d1bb9b5dc14b9d0.webm?t=1752217469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/1c3bdf7b864373012d1bb9b5dc14b9d0.mp4?t=1752217469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/dc11d7030a40092bbf3bb77119e15f4b.avif?t=1752217469\" width=616 height=132 /></span>Play through the level-based story mode and follow the Clippy Commando's adventure as you save the Clipenberg Empire from the threat of the Rulerian Alliance! Each level has a variety of unique optional objectives that offer anything from unique dialogue between the Clippy Commando and fellow war criminal Quartermaster Unicorn to unlocking one of the hundreds of cosmetics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/fa235d11d47c15710d2a02e439904dbc.poster.avif?t=1752217469\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/fa235d11d47c15710d2a02e439904dbc.webm?t=1752217469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/fa235d11d47c15710d2a02e439904dbc.mp4?t=1752217469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/5ae8bf1e2e63a15d44613f31756a28eb.avif?t=1752217469\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15+ Infinite Mode challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ Infinite Mode maps, each with unique game-play elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ Weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Customizable Infinite Mode game-play modifiers to tailor your experience </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Story Mode levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >250+ Cosmetics with over 1,500,000,000 different possible combinations, all earned through game-play </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/93f6872f4c15d7db6608b34156878899.poster.avif?t=1752217469\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/93f6872f4c15d7db6608b34156878899.webm?t=1752217469\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2976610/extras/93f6872f4c15d7db6608b34156878899.mp4?t=1752217469\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Thanks for Playing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976610/72f58053b06020049d1efea3252351cb60c273ab.jpg"},{"name":"You Shouldn't Be Proud of This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976610/66a9381b9783c1b987ca8d67ff901c8d10d5808b.jpg"},{"name":"Procurer of Arms","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976610/7389166daf482354d687e155ad072035d698c493.jpg"},{"name":"Decorated War Criminal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976610/d42a76e6d31a97983ab6478066d4c294d06924f8.jpg"},{"name":"It Rains Casings Here","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2976610/98d30525e0c68db84680d6db5111f55423b2e768.jpg"},{"name":"A World of Color","path":"https://cdn.akamai.s